We need to be intentional about what actually goes into that string, though. =
If it ends up as three different phrasings of the same situation depending on=
 which code path filled it in, the display becomes noise. I would keep it to =
a small set of reasons we can write down now and extend deliberately later, a=
nd I would write them in language a user can read, not an internal identifier.

